<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="band faq-band" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head center rv">
      <h2 class="display">Common questions</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="faq rv">
      <details class="faq-item" open>
        <summary>What is LasagnaFi?</summary>
        <p>It reads your connected accounts and tells you what to do with your money next. Not a budgeting app, and not a spreadsheet you fill in yourself.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Does it use AI?</summary>
        <p>Yes, for the actions and the chat. Your identity is <b>never</b> sent: name, institution and account numbers are tokenized first, so the model only ever sees figures.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Why is there a paid tier?</summary>
        <p>Plaid, the AI and the servers all cost money per user. Pro covers that. You do not have to pay: the free tier gives you 2 connected institutions and every tool, and self-hosting is unlimited.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
